  axis: "new",
  kind: "brief",
  title: "Hardware primer \u2014 mobile manipulation for luxury reverse logistics",
  dek: "Fourteen topics on hardware architecture and component selection for advising Aqilis on a deployment at The RealReal, written on the premise that unique consigned items break the amortisation that makes Amazon-style manipulation work.",
  status: "live",
