  title: "Linux, git and GitHub from the ground up",
  dek: "The infrastructure layer under every robotics codebase, taught from zero: the three places git keeps your code, what a home directory actually is, how Linux differs from Windows and macOS, and the Unix commands worth knowing.",
  status: "current",
